deo Main Road, Mumbai- 400034, inter alia, to transact the following business:\r\n1. To consider and approve the Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Statements for the quarter and half year ended as on 30th September, 2026.\r\n2. Any other business with the permission of the Chair", "NEWSID": "3f28bcfb-e97a-4aab-89ae-3a8b7c9846af", "NEWSSUB": "Board Meeting Intimation for Intimation Of The Meeting Of The Board Of Directors As Per Regulation 29 Of LODR", "NEWS_DT": "2026-11-02T17:10:37.54", "NSURL": "https://www.bseindia.com/stock-share-price/sunraj-diamond-exports-ltd/sunrajdi/523425/", "News_submission_dt": "2026-11-02T17:10:35", "OLD": 1, "PDFFLAG": 1, "QUARTER_ID": null, "RN": 1, "SCRIP_CD": 523425, "SLONGNAME": "Sunraj Diamond Exports Ltd", "SUBCATNAME": "Board Meeting", "TimeDiff": "00:00:02", "XML_NAME": "ANN_523425_3F28BCFB-E97A-4AAB-89AE-3A8B7C9846AF"}]